The laptop is the only item left, and my cap is $369. S4's ask of $395 is above that. My $362 bid stays acceptable this round. Any offer I post now becomes firm for round 6, the last chance to trade.

S4's only other option is B11 at $319, so my bid already beats that by $43. Still, raising to my $369 cap for the final round only costs $7 and covers the case where S4's minimum sits just above $362.

